-- arguments: a person of s 254(3) other than (a); becomes aware in the window; (a) false or misleading; (b) omission; (c)(i) new circumstance; (c)(ii) would have been required; materially adverse; notified in writing as soon as practicable
#ASSERT (`s 252(1) the person has notified the person making the offer` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 252(1) the person has notified the person making the offer` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an omission
